---
layout: base.njk
title: "Developer & Security Tools — Penumbra Forge"
description: "Inspect email headers, convert cryptographic keys, test regex performance, and work with security evidence. A selected collection of free tools that run in your browser."
permalink: /tools/
hideAtmosphere: true
---
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tools.css?v={{ assetv }}">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tools-curated.css?v={{ assetv }}">
{% set liveTools = [] %}
{% for tool in tools %}{% if tool.status == "live" %}{% set liveTools = (liveTools.push(tool), liveTools) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% set selectedCount = toolCollection.featured.length %}
{% for lane in toolCollection.lanes %}{% set selectedCount = selectedCount + lane.tools.length %}{% endfor %}
{% macro pin(tool) %}
<button type="button" class="pin-tool" data-pin="{{ tool.slug }}" data-name="{{ tool.name }}" aria-label="Pin {{ tool.name }}" aria-pressed="false" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l2.8 5.7 6.2.9-4.5 4.4 1.1 6.2L12 17.3l-5.6 2.9 1.1-6.2L3 9.6l6.2-.9z"/></svg></button>
{% endmacro %}
{% macro row(tool, searchRow=false) %}
<article class="tool-row"{% if searchRow %} data-search-row data-slug="{{ tool.slug }}" data-name="{{ tool.name }}" data-cat="{{ tool.category }}" data-keywords="{{ (tool.keywords or []) | join(' ') }}"{% if tool.featured %} data-featured="1"{% endif %}{% if tool.isNew %} data-new="1"{% endif %}{% endif %}>
  <a href="/tools/{{ tool.slug }}/">
    <div class="tool-row-title"><h3>{{ tool.name }}</h3></div>
    <p class="tool-row-description">{{ tool.description }}</p>
    <span class="tool-row-meta">{% if tool.usesAiEngine %}AI · check route{% elif tool.badge == "worker" %}Edge worker{% elif tool.badge == "cloud" %}Network{% else %}In your browser{% endif %}</span>
    <span class="tool-row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
  </a>
  {{ pin(tool) }}
</article>
{% endmacro %}
<div class="wb-page">
  {% include "header.njk" %}
  <main class="tool-collection" id="main-content">
    <header class="collection-top">
      <div class="collection-title">
        <p class="collection-eyebrow">Penumbra Forge / The collection</p>
        <h1>Tools</h1>
        <p>A few good instruments for the work in front of you.<br>Free to use. No account. These {{ selectedCount }} run in your browser.</p>
      </div>
      <form class="collection-search" action="/tools/all/" role="search">
        <label for="collectionSearch">Find a tool in the full collection</label>
        <input id="collectionSearch" type="search" name="q" placeholder="Email headers, keys, JSON…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" aria-controls="collectionResults">
        <button type="submit">Find</button>
      </form>
    </header>
    <div class="collection-toolbar">
      <nav aria-label="Browse tools">
        <button type="button" class="active" data-view="selected" aria-pressed="true" hidden>Selected</button>
        <button type="button" data-view="pinned" aria-pressed="false" hidden>Pinned <span id="pinCount">0</span></button>
        <a href="/tools/all/">Full index <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
      <p class="collection-count" id="collectionCount">{{ selectedCount }} selected tools</p>
    </div>

    <div class="collection-curated" id="collectionCurated">
      <section class="collection-feature" aria-labelledby="email-feature-title">
        <div class="feature-copy">
          <p class="specimen-label">01 / Trace a message</p>
          <h2 id="email-feature-title">Email Header<br>Forensics</h2>
          <p>Follow the route behind an email. Read delivery hops, authentication results, and mismatched identities in one place.</p>
          <div class="feature-actions"><a class="tool-open" href="/tools/email-header-forensics/">Inspect email headers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{{ pin({slug: 'email-header-forensics', name: 'Email Header Forensics'}) }}</div>
          <p class="processing-note">Headers stay in your browser.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="email-specimen" aria-label="Illustrative email header trace">
          <div class="specimen-top"><span>MESSAGE TRACE</span><span>Synthetic example</span></div>
          <dl class="email-meta"><dt>From</dt><dd>sender@example.com</dd><dt>To</dt><dd>you@example.net</dd></dl>
          <ol class="mail-route">
            <li><strong>mail.example.com</strong><span>Origin · 192.0.2.10</span></li>
            <li><strong>relay.example.net</strong><span>Relay · 198.51.100.20</span></li>
            <li><strong>mx.example.net</strong><span>Destination · 203.0.113.30</span></li>
          </ol>
          <div class="mail-auth"><span>SPF · pass</span><span>DKIM · pass</span><span>DMARC · pass</span></div>
          <p class="specimen-caption">Results reported in the header. Not an independent verification of the sender.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="collection-pair">
        <section class="tool-feature" aria-labelledby="keys-feature-title">
          <div class="feature-copy">
            <p class="specimen-label">02 / Work with keys</p>
            <h2 id="keys-feature-title">Key Converter</h2>
            <p>Move between JWK and PEM. Inspect key details or generate an RSA or EC key pair.</p>
            <div class="feature-actions"><a class="tool-open" href="/tools/key-converter/">Convert a key <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{{ pin({slug: 'key-converter', name: 'Key Converter'}) }}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-specimen"><span class="specimen-label">Formats, untangled</span><pre><code>JWK  ⇄  PEM

RSA · EC
Public · Private
SPKI · PKCS#8</code></pre></div>
        </section>
        <section class="tool-feature" aria-labelledby="regex-feature-title">
          <div class="feature-copy">
            <p class="specimen-label">03 / Probe a pattern</p>
            <h2 id="regex-feature-title">ReDoS Tester</h2>
            <p>Time a regex against growing input in an isolated worker. Stop runaway tests without freezing the page.</p>
            <div class="feature-actions"><a class="tool-open" href="/tools/redos-tester/">Test a pattern <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{{ pin({slug: 'redos-tester', name: 'ReDoS Tester'}) }}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-specimen"><span class="specimen-label">A costly near-match</span><pre><code>/^(a+)+$/

aaaaaaaaaaaaa!
↳ failure suffix

Bounded timing test</code></pre></div>
        </section>
      </div>
      {% for lane in toolCollection.lanes %}
      <section class="collection-lane" aria-labelledby="lane-{{ loop.index }}">
        <div class="lane-heading"><h2 id="lane-{{ loop.index }}">{{ lane.title }}</h2><p>{{ lane.description }}</p></div>
        <div class="lane-tools">
          {% for slug in lane.tools %}{% for tool in liveTools %}{% if tool.slug == slug %}{{ row(tool) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </section>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <section class="collection-search-results" id="collectionResults" aria-label="Tool search results" hidden>
      <div class="search-summary"><p id="searchCount" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><button type="button" id="collectionReset">Back to selected tools</button></div>
      <div class="search-list">{% for tool in liveTools %}{{ row(tool, true) }}{% endfor %}</div>
      <div class="collection-empty" id="collectionEmpty" hidden><h2>No tools found.</h2><p>Try a broader search, or return to the selected collection.</p><button type="button" id="collectionEmptyReset">Show selected tools <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
    </section>
    <div class="collection-endcap"><h2>Need something specific?</h2><p>The full index keeps every utility within reach. Network and AI tools show their processing route.</p><a href="/tools/all/">Browse all {{ liveTools.length }} tools <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <p class="collection-pin-note" id="pinNote" hidden>Pins stay in this browser.</p>
  </main>
  {% include "command-palette.njk" %}
</div>
<script defer src="/js/tools-curated.js?v={{ assetv }}"></script>
